<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Get Found on OzarkRoost — $49 Business Listing</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Put your Ozarks business in front of travelers looking for cabins, restaurants, fishing, camping, adventures, rentals and things to do. Start at $49/month.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400,0,9..40,500,0,9..40,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <style>
    .sales-hero{background:var(--pine);color:var(--cream);padding:78px 24px 70px;text-align:center}.sales-hero__inner{max-width:900px;margin:auto}.sales-hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,76px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.02;margin:12px 0 18px}.sales-hero p{max-width:720px;margin:auto;color:rgba(245,240,232,.78);font-size:18px;line-height:1.65}.sales-badge{display:inline-block;border:1px solid rgba(245,240,232,.25);border-radius:50px;padding:8px 15px;color:var(--amber-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.sales-hero__price{font-size:15px;margin-top:24px!important;color:var(--cream)!important}.sales-hero__price strong{font-size:30px}.sales-wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:62px 24px}.sales-section{margin-bottom:64px}.sales-heading{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 30px}.sales-heading h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);font-weight:400;margin:0 0 10px}.sales-heading p{color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.65}.plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.plan{position:relative;border:1px solid rgba(28,61,42,.12);border-radius:18px;background:#fff;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(14,34,18,.06)}.plan--featured{border:2px solid var(--amber);transform:translateY(-6px)}.plan__tag{position:absolute;top:-13px;left:20px;background:var(--amber);color:#fff;border-radius:50px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.plan h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:400;margin:0}.plan__price{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0}.plan__price small{font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text-muted)}.plan ul{padding-left:20px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.75;font-size:14px;min-height:145px}.plan label{display:block;border:1px solid rgba(28,61,42,.12);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;cursor:pointer}.plan input{margin-right:8px}.coverage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.coverage-card{background:var(--cream-dark);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}.coverage-card strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:6px}.coverage-card span{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.step{padding:22px;border-top:2px solid var(--amber)}.step b{font-size:12px;color:var(--amber-dark)}.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:21px;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0}.step p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.55}.form-card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:34px;box-shadow:0 8px 35px rgba(14,34,18,.08);border:1px solid rgba(28,61,42,.08)}.form-card h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:32px;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 8px}.form-card>p{color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:0}.lyc-form{margin-top:24px}.form-row{display:grid;gap:18px}.form-row--two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.form-group{margin-bottom:18px}.form-group label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:7px}.form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid rgba(28,61,42,.16);border-radius:9px;padding:12px 13px;font:inherit;background:#fff}.required{color:var(--amber-dark)}.form-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)}.form-error{background:#fff1ef;border:1px solid #e4aaa1;padding:12px;border-radius:9px;margin:15px 0}.form-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(28,61,42,.1);padding-top:20px}.form-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5}.btn-wide{min-width:280px}.proof{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.proof-card{padding:22px;background:var(--cream-dark);border-radius:14px}.proof-card strong{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:7px}.proof-card span{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.55}.fineprint{text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:12px;max-width:760px;margin:25px auto 0;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:850px){.plans,.coverage,.process{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.plan--featured{transform:none}}@media(max-width:600px){.plans,.coverage,.process,.proof,.form-row--two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-footer{display:block}.btn-wide{width:100%;margin-top:14px}.form-card{padding:22px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="site-nav"><div class="site-nav__inner"><a href="/" class="site-nav__logo">OzarkRoost</a><div class="site-nav__links"><a href="/listings">Explore</a><a href="/adventures">Adventures</a><a href="/guides/ozarks-camping-rv">Camping</a><a href="#apply" class="site-nav__cta">Get Listed</a></div></div></nav>
<header class="sales-hero"><div class="sales-hero__inner"><span class="sales-badge">For Ozarks business owners</span><h1>Get found by people already planning the Ozarks.</h1><p>OzarkRoost brings stays, food, fishing, camping, adventures, rentals, attractions and outdoor gear into one trip-planning destination. Put your business where travelers are looking.</p><p class="sales-hero__price"><strong>$49/month</strong> to get started · $99 Featured · $149 Dominant</p></div></header>
<main class="sales-wrap">
<section class="sales-section"><div class="sales-heading"><h2>Pick the visibility that fits your business</h2><p>Start with the lowest-cost way in. Upgrade when you want more prominence. Your subscription is only charged through the Stripe checkout you choose.</p></div><div class="plans">
<article class="plan"><h3>Starter</h3><div class="plan__price">$49 <small>/ month</small></div><ul><li>Premium business listing</li><li>Business description and website link</li><li>Category and location discovery</li><li>Eligible for OzarkRoost search/discovery placement</li></ul><label><input type="radio" name="plan_choice" value="starter" checked form="listing-form">Choose Starter</label></article>
<article class="plan plan--featured"><span class="plan__tag">MOST POPULAR</span><h3>Featured</h3><div class="plan__price">$99 <small>/ month</small></div><ul><li>Everything in Starter</li><li>More prominent featured placement</li><li>Stronger visibility across relevant discovery pages</li><li>Built for businesses ready to grow trip traffic</li></ul><label><input type="radio" name="plan_choice" value="featured" form="listing-form">Choose Featured</label></article>
<article class="plan"><h3>Dominant</h3><div class="plan__price">$149 <small>/ month</small></div><ul><li>Everything in Featured</li><li>Maximum premium placement</li><li>Priority visibility opportunities</li><li>Built for high-value Ozarks operators</li></ul><label><input type="radio" name="plan_choice" value="dominant" form="listing-form">Choose Dominant</label></article>
</div></section>
<section class="sales-section"><div class="sales-heading"><h2>Not just cabins.</h2><p>Sell the whole Ozarks experience. If travelers spend money with your business, you belong in the Roost.</p></div><div class="coverage">
<div class="coverage-card"><strong>🏡 Lodging & rentals</strong><span>Cabins, vacation homes, resorts, hotels, glamping, RV sites and campgrounds.</span></div>
<div class="coverage-card"><strong>🍽️ Food & drink</strong><span>Restaurants, cafés, bars, breweries and local food destinations.</span></div>
<div class="coverage-card"><strong>🛶 Adventures</strong><span>Float trips, canoe/kayak rentals, guides, outfitters, tours, trails and attractions.</span></div>
<div class="coverage-card"><strong>🎣 Outdoors & gear</strong><span>Fishing, hunting, camping, marinas, rentals, outdoor services and gear retailers.</span></div>
</div></section>
<section class="sales-section"><div class="sales-heading"><h2>Turn a stranger into a customer in four steps.</h2></div><div class="process"><div class="step"><b>01</b><h3>Get discovered</h3><p>Travelers find your business through OzarkRoost categories, guides and trip-planning pages.</p></div><div class="step"><b>02</b><h3>See your offer</h3><p>Your listing sends qualified visitors to your website, booking page, phone or destination.</p></div><div class="step"><b>03</b><h3>Book direct</h3><p>We don't take a commission on your booking. You control your customer relationship.</p></div><div class="step"><b>04</b><h3>Grow visibility</h3><p>Upgrade from Starter to Featured or Dominant when you want more premium exposure.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="apply" class="sales-section"><div class="form-card"><h2>Claim your OzarkRoost listing</h2><p>Choose your plan above, tell us about the business, then continue to secure Stripe checkout.</p><% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %><div class="form-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form id="listing-form" class="lyc-form" method="POST" action="/list-your-cabin"><input type="hidden" id="tier" name="tier" value="<%= typeof tier !== 'undefined' ? tier : 'starter' %>"><input type="hidden" name="source" value="<%= typeof acquisitionSource !== 'undefined' ? acquisitionSource : 'website' %>"><input type="hidden" name="campaign" value="premium_listing"><input type="hidden" id="content" name="content" value="<%= typeof tier !== 'undefined' ? tier : 'starter' %>">
<div class="form-row form-row--two"><div class="form-group"><label for="owner_name">Your Name <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="text" id="owner_name" name="owner_name" required placeholder="Your name" value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.owner_name ? values.owner_name : '' %>"></div><div class="form-group"><label for="owner_email">Business Email <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="email" id="owner_email" name="owner_email" required placeholder="you@yourbusiness.com" value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.owner_email ? values.owner_email : '' %>"></div></div>
<div class="form-row form-row--two"><div class="form-group"><label for="property_name">Business / Property Name <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="text" id="property_name" name="property_name" required placeholder="Your business name" value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.property_name ? values.property_name : '' %>"></div><div class="form-group"><label for="location">Ozarks Location <span class="required">*</span></label><input type="text" id="location" name="location" required placeholder="Jasper, AR" value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.location ? values.location : '' %>"></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label for="property_type">Business Type <span class="required">*</span></label><select id="property_type" name="property_type" required><option value="">Choose your category…</option><option value="cabin">Cabin / Vacation Rental</option><option value="hotel">Hotel / Resort / Inn</option><option value="rv">RV Site / Campground</option><option value="glamping">Glamping</option><option value="restaurant">Restaurant / Café / Bar / Brewery</option><option value="adventure">Adventure / Tour / Attraction</option><option value="guide">Fishing Guide / Outfitter</option><option value="rental">Boat / Kayak / Equipment Rental</option><option value="marina">Marina / Lake Business</option><option value="retail">Outdoor Gear / Retail</option><option value="event">Event / Show / Experience</option><option value="other">Other Ozarks Business</option></select></div>
<div class="form-group"><label for="description">Why should travelers choose you?</label><textarea id="description" name="description" rows="4" placeholder="What do you offer, where are you located, and what makes the experience worth the trip?"><%= (typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.description) ? values.description : '' %></textarea></div>
<div class="form-row form-row--two"><div class="form-group"><label for="photo_url">Photo URL</label><input type="url" id="photo_url" name="photo_url" placeholder="https://example.com/photo.jpg"><span class="form-hint">Optional. You can update your listing information later.</span></div><div class="form-group"><label for="website_url">Website / Booking Link</label><input type="url" id="website_url" name="website_url" placeholder="https://yourbusiness.com"><span class="form-hint">Send travelers directly to your booking, menu, reservation or business page.</span></div></div>
<div class="form-footer"><p class="form-note">Secure checkout is handled by Stripe. Your card is not charged by submitting this form; payment happens only when you complete Stripe Checkout.</p><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg btn-wide">Continue with My $<span id="button-price">49</span>/month Plan →</button></div></form></div></section>
<section class="sales-section"><div class="sales-heading"><h2>Why businesses join</h2></div><div class="proof"><div class="proof-card"><strong>Built for trip intent</strong><span>Reach people researching where to stay, eat, fish, camp and play—not a generic audience.</span></div><div class="proof-card"><strong>Direct customer path</strong><span>Your website or booking link is part of the listing so travelers can take the next step.</span></div><div class="proof-card"><strong>Simple recurring pricing</strong><span>Start at $49/month. Upgrade only when the extra visibility makes sense for you.</span></div></div><p class="fineprint">Listings are subject to basic quality and relevance review. OzarkRoost does not fabricate reviews, bookings or traffic. Paid placement is clearly a paid placement, and customer payments are processed through Stripe.</p></section>
</main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script>
const prices={starter:49,featured:99,dominant:149};
document.querySelectorAll('input[name="plan_choice"]').forEach(r=>r.addEventListener('change',()=>{document.getElementById('tier').value=r.value;document.getElementById('content').value=r.value;document.getElementById('button-price').textContent=prices[r.value];}));
</script>
</body></html>
